The second argument (regs->si) is the current socket.
When it equals SEQ_START_TOKEN, that is the header line: return 0 to let it
through.

For data rows, cast v to struct sock *, then call inet_sk() to get the
inet_sock.
Compare ntohs(inet->inet_sport) against hidden_port.
Return 1 to skip tcp4_seq_show (hiding the port), 0 to let it execute.
